WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
[The phone rings while the robot waits.]

00:08.000 --> 00:24.000
The robot detects the ring, picks up the phone, and presents it to the user.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
[A short phone conversation takes place.]

00:36.000 --> 00:41.354
The robot detects the end of the call and returns the phone.
